    given-names: Sina
repository-code: "https://github.com/sinaghadermarzi/agentic-lab"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
keywords:
  - agents
  - llm
  - course
  - jupyter
  - evaluation
abstract: >-
  A 21-chapter course that builds the machinery of agentic systems by hand
  (tool loop, tracing, evaluation, budgets, approval gates, checkpoints,
  context management, MCP, A2A) in one small micro-world, then meets the
  frameworks as packagings of parts the reader already owns.
